58", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_1517280296816191_3248062158835930793_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cHiVx9wEALUQ7kNvwGeqMWq&_nc_oc=AdqI6x4LmfSYiROme9vogfFKn3IZJNc8ZkHFU9rItHXaV52gmoSXUrdW7X7RpBiOLJM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPiyBp9V3gNc0JY1JOUNQQS2oNzCUmBS57GPdrPbQhpUA&oe=6AE210CD"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 4.png", "id": "2180576715838619", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620985_2180576719171952_4179132521064836612_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bjjyBwLlQP0Q7kNvwENFdJm&_nc_oc=AdpeIJgUOMRugi_SIcYstB0h3r39c0msAdJfU6R-nmdaZqANR7vaxtlzPs5NmqB0q70&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM3ajmq8LwbYLAgVRYmsyoU7ldFAJXPFExJaDwkpOdT1A&oe=6AE219A6"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 5.png", "id": "1342847194692771", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622162_1342847198026104_6158502527951782000_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0xaLTsIuzSwQ7kNvwEE-MMX&_nc_oc=Adq1koxJOFEriwJNQ3B6ejKbtjasDi2xK7Q0blmqkqBI1cSseYWZyppMt__kcOJWWCQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQObuKvQkqbwv-6yOFmZc2WsZ5lZJmuv_hNXx4nrNiQpmQ&oe=6AE1F251"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "hvac personal thumbnail.png", "id": "1365445488881358", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_1365445492214691_7647014581930130160_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XKmoAcncIs8Q7kNvwE8Q6en&_nc_oc=Adplxiu5cX_Aprh8U9rGliOYL86upPzfD0kxQucNyzkiScZejm2u6znyw001O1EkpfQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNfNB9JU6hEW9NoBCehtxfnSvEV-5wysYjCzqAdETyydQ&oe=6AE218B4"}, "display_name": "Skillveri HVAC Simulator-Personal Use", "keywords": ["skillveri", "hvac", "simulator", "cte", "vr"], "long_description": "The simulation technology that powers workforce training in the world\u2019s leading industries, now in a personal use version for individuals!\nStep into a fully immersive HVAC training environment with Skillveri HVAC Simulator - Personal Use edition.\n\nForget watching videos - start doing. Using Skillveri\u2019s advanced hand-tracking technology, you can perform all actions naturally with your hands, just as you would in the field - no controllers needed!\n\nThe realistic VR simulation for aspiring HVAC techs, this Personal version offers you hands-on practice anytime, anywhere.\n\nImmerse yourself in a realistic scenario and navigate complex tasks with ease using visual cues and step by step instructions.\n\nThis Personal version contains:\n- Commercial HVAC Cleaning and Maintenance\n- Residential HVAC Leak Testing\n\nReady to scale your training or adopt it for your institution? For our fully-loaded Enterprise version, perfect for schools and training institutions, contact us at usa@skillveri.com. Skillveri simulators are used across 100+ schools and colleges across the USA in their CTE programs.", "short_description": "Master HVAC skills in immersive VR - no risk, no tools, no wastage. Perform all actions with your hands exactly as in real life - no VR controllers needed! Perfect for building real-world confidence before stepping onto a job site.\n\nIn this Personal Use edition, learn Commercial HVAC cleaning & Residential HVAC leak testing inside realistic 3D environments. Hands-on practice - anytime, anywhere, at your own pace.\n\nWrite to usa@skillveri.com for the Enterprise version for schools or institutions."}]}, "developer_name": "Skillveri Inc", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skillveri.com/kelvin-lite-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skillveri Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.skillveri.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_to